<title>USA: Franklin Credit Q1 loss widens.</title>
<headline>Franklin Credit Q1 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		    1996</p>
<p>    Revenues			 $2,961		 $3,188</p>
<p>    Net Income			($184)		  ($94)</p>
<p>    Net income per share	   (.16)		  (.08)</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding	    1,164		  1,128</p>
<p>	 (In thousands of dollars, except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Franklin Credit Management Corp said the wider net loss resulted from the acquisition of a large volume of loan portfolios at the close of the fourth quarter of 1996 and in the first quarter of 1997, and the expenses connected with those purchases.</p>
</text>
